Day 2 - OU and Security Group Documentation

Organizational Units:
- Finance
- HR
- IT
- Operations

Security Groups:
- Finance-Users
- HR-Users
- IT-Users
- Operations-Users

Purpose:
- Finance OU: Stores Finance department user accounts.
- Finance-Users: Security group used to assign Finance users department-based access and permissions.

- HR OU: Stores HR department user accounts.
- HR-Users: Security group used to assign HR users department-based access and permissions.

- IT OU: Stores IT department user accounts.
- IT-Users: Security group used to assign IT users department-based access and permissions.

- Operations OU: Stores Operations department user accounts.
- Operations-Users: Security group used to assign Operations users department-based access and permissions.

These OUs and security groups were created to organize users by department and support role-based access control (RBAC) within the NMG.com domain.
